# ST Writer Elite: TEMPLATE.TXT (from its own disk) printed with the
# print dialog's defaults (Printer, Draft). The program disk is drive B,
# unmodified; the launcher in drive A starts B:\STWRITER.PRG at boot
# (tools/dev/make_launcher.py). Reference runs (bare or stock): the printer
# port's bytes and whether they all went through TOS's printer routine.
@printer
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/launchers/stwriter.st
@disk-b $PROGRAM_DISKS/st_writer_elite_4_0/files/st_writer_elite_atari_(usa).st
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 1300
key l
wait 150
type template.txt
key 0x1c
wait 200
key p
wait 150
printwatch
key 0x1c
printer 100 3000
